This is the comprehensive feature blueprint for the HI-TECH College Integrated Digital Academic & Certification Platform. It covers the entire college operation, from public website and student admission to academic management, examinations, finance, human resources, certification, reporting and institutional governance.

The platform should operate as one integrated system, with different permissions and dashboards for each user.

