37. What the completed HI-TECH College platform should achieve
The institution should be able to manage its entire operation from a single platform:

Advertise courses and recruit students.

Receive applications and admit students.

Register students into programmes and units.

Manage lecturers, departments and teaching.

Deliver online and physical learning.

Conduct CATs, assignments and examinations.

Mark assessments and publish approved results.

