Manage employees, payroll and procurement.

Operate the library and student welfare services.

Issue and verify certificates and transcripts.

Communicate with students, parents and staff.

Monitor institutional performance.

Maintain secure records and regulatory compliance.

This is the proposed master scope for the HI-TECH College platform. It is intentionally broader than an ordinary school management system: it is an integrated college ERP, SIS, LMS, examination platform and institutional management system.

